<!-- 
Họ và tên: Nguyễn Tùng Dương
Mã sinh viên: 23103100003
Nội dung thực hiện: Module 5 - Giao diện Báo cáo Thống kê
-->
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Báo cáo Thống kê";
    var doanhThu = ViewBag.DoanhThuTheoThang as IEnumerable<QuanLyDangKyKhoaHoc_UNETI04_TI17A1HN.ViewModels.ThongKeDoanhThuVM>;
    var tyLe = ViewBag.TyLeLapDay as IEnumerable<QuanLyDangKyKhoaHoc_UNETI04_TI17A1HN.ViewModels.TyLeLapDayVM>;
    var dkTrangThai = ViewBag.DKTheoTrangThai as IEnumerable<dynamic>;
    var dkTheoLop = ViewBag.DKTheoLop as IEnumerable<dynamic>;
    var diemTB = ViewBag.DiemTBTheoLop as IEnumerable<dynamic>;
    var buoiHocThang = ViewBag.BuoiHocTheoThang as IEnumerable<dynamic>;
}

<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
        <!-- Page Header -->
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">Báo cáo Thống kê</h1>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed">
                        Dữ liệu thời gian thực
                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">
                    Tổng hợp chỉ số tài chính học phí, tỷ lệ lấp đầy lớp, tiến độ đăng ký và chất lượng đào tạo
                </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Header Action Controls -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
                <!-- Semester Selector -->
                <div class="relative inline-flex items-center">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-3 text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant pointer-events-none">calendar_today</span>
                    <select class="h-10 pl-9 pr-8 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary/20 appearance-none cursor-pointer">
                        <option selected="">Học kỳ 1 • 2024 - 2025</option>
                        <option>Học kỳ 2 • 2023 - 2024</option>
                        <option>Học kỳ Hè • 2023 - 2024</option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute right-2.5 text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant pointer-events-none">expand_more</span>
                </div>
                <!-- Export Action -->
                <button class="h-10 px-3.5 bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors" type="button">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary">file_download</span>
                    <span class="">Xuất file PDF/Excel</span>
                </button>
                <!-- Refresh Action -->
                <button class="h-10 px-3.5 bg-primary-container hover:bg-inverse-surface text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md rounded-lg shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all" type="button">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary-container">sync</span>
                    <span class="">Làm mới dữ liệu</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Grid Layout: 2 Columns, 6 Compact UI Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2 gap-5 w-full">
            
            <!-- Card 1: Doanh thu theo Tháng -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">payments</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Doanh thu theo Tháng</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Thu chi ngân sách học phí theo niên khóa</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface bg-surface-container-low px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">
                                Tổng cộng: <strong class="font-semibold text-secondary">@string.Format("{0:N0}", doanhThu?.Sum(d => d.TongDoanhThu) ?? 0) ₫</strong>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase border-b border-outline-variant/30">
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3">Tháng</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">Học phí thu được</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">Tỷ lệ hoàn thành</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="divide-y divide-outline-variant/20 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
                                @if(doanhThu != null)
                                {
                                    @foreach(var item in doanhThu)
                                    {
                                        <tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 transition-colors">
                                            <td class="py-2 px-3 font-label-md">Tháng @item.Thang</td>
                                            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-medium">@string.Format("{0:N0}", item.TongDoanhThu) ₫</td>
                                            <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right"><span class="font-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container bg-tertiary-fixed/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">100%</span></td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Tỷ lệ Lấp đầy Lớp học -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">pie_chart</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Tỷ lệ Lấp đầy Lớp học</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Sức chứa phòng học và khả năng đáp ứng</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase border-b border-outline-variant/30">
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3">Lớp học phần</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center">Tối đa</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center">Hiện tại</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3 w-40">Tỷ lệ</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="divide-y divide-outline-variant/20 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
                                @if(tyLe != null)
                                {
                                    @foreach(var item in tyLe)
                                    {
                                        <tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 transition-colors">
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-3">
                                                <div class="flex flex-col">
                                                    <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface">@item.TenLop</span>
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center text-on-surface-variant">@item.SiSoToiDa</td>
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center font-semibold text-on-surface">@item.SiSoHienTai</td>
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-3">
                                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                                    <div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden">
                                                        <div class="bg-on-tertiary-container h-2 rounded-full" style="width: @item.TyLe.ToString("0", System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)%"></div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium text-on-tertiary-container min-w-[36px] text-right">@item.TyLe.ToString("0.0")%</span>
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: Thống kê Đăng ký theo Trạng thái -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">assignment_turned_in</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Thống kê Đăng ký theo Trạng thái</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Tiến độ phê duyệt tín chỉ học phần</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="space-y-2.5">
                        @if(dkTrangThai != null)
                        {
                            @foreach(var item in dkTrangThai)
                            {
                                string colorRing = item.Ten == "Đã duyệt" || item.Ten == "Đã đóng học phí" || item.Ten == "Đang học" ? "bg-tertiary-fixed-dim ring-tertiary-fixed/30" :
                                             (item.Ten == "Đã hủy" || item.Ten == "Từ chối" ? "bg-error ring-error-container" : "bg-secondary-container ring-secondary-fixed/50");
                                
                                string colorText = item.Ten == "Đã duyệt" || item.Ten == "Đã đóng học phí" || item.Ten == "Đang học" ? "text-on-tertiary-container bg-tertiary-fixed/30" :
                                             (item.Ten == "Đã hủy" || item.Ten == "Từ chối" ? "text-error bg-error-container" : "text-on-secondary-container bg-secondary-fixed");

                                <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                        <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full @colorRing ring-4"></span>
                                        <div>
                                            <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface block">@item.Ten</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                        <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-surface">@item.SoLuong</span>
                                        <span class="inline-flex items-center text-label-sm font-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded @colorText">
                                            Hồ sơ
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            }
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4: Top Lớp học phần Đăng ký Nhiều nhất -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">military_tech</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Top Lớp học phần Đăng ký Nhiều nhất</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Xếp hạng nhu cầu tín chỉ sinh viên</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        @if(dkTheoLop != null)
                        {
                            int rank = 1;
                            var top5 = dkTheoLop.OrderByDescending(x => x.SoLuong).Take(5);
                            @foreach(var item in top5)
                            {
                                string rankColor = rank == 1 ? "bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed" :
                                                   (rank == 2 ? "bg-outline-variant/40 text-on-surface" :
                                                   (rank == 3 ? "bg-surface-variant text-on-surface-variant" : "bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant"));
                                                   
                                string scoreColor = rank == 1 ? "bg-secondary text-on-secondary" :
                                                    (rank == 2 ? "bg-inverse-surface text-on-primary" :
                                                    (rank == 3 ? "bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface" : "bg-surface-container text-on-surface"));

                                <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container/60 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-label-md @rankColor">
                                            @rank
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                                            <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface leading-snug truncate" style="max-width: 200px;" title="@item.Ten">@item.Ten</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-right">
                                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-label-md text-label-md font-bold @scoreColor">@item.SoLuong SV</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                rank++;
                            }
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 5: Điểm Trung bình Kết thúc theo Lớp -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">school</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Điểm Trung bình Kết thúc theo Lớp</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Đánh giá chuẩn đầu ra và chất lượng môn</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase border-b border-outline-variant/30">
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3">Lớp học phần</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center">Điểm TB</th>
                                    <th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">Đánh giá</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="divide-y divide-outline-variant/20 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
                                @if(diemTB != null)
                                {
                                    @foreach(var item in diemTB)
                                    {
                                        <tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 transition-colors">
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-label-md truncate" style="max-width: 150px;">@item.Ten</td>
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-center font-bold text-on-tertiary-container bg-tertiary-fixed/20 rounded">@(((double)item.DiemTB).ToString("0.0"))</td>
                                            <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">
                                                @if(item.DiemTB >= 8.0) {
                                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-tertiary-fixed/40 text-on-tertiary-container font-medium">Xuất sắc</span>
                                                }
                                                else if (item.DiemTB >= 6.5) {
                                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-medium">Khá</span>
                                                }
                                                else if (item.DiemTB >= 4.0) {
                                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Đạt</span>
                                                }
                                                else {
                                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-error-container text-error font-medium">Kém</span>
                                                }
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 6: Phân bổ Lịch học theo Tháng -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-2">
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">bar_chart</span>
                                <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Phân bổ Lịch học theo Tháng</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Số ca học tổ chức giảng dạy trực tiếp</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- CSS Bar Chart Visualization -->
                    <div class="pt-5 pb-2">
                        <div class="h-40 flex items-end justify-between gap-3 px-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30">
                            @if(buoiHocThang != null && buoiHocThang.Any())
                            {
                                var maxBuoi = Enumerable.Max(buoiHocThang.Select(x => (int)x.SoLuong));
                                
                                @foreach(var item in buoiHocThang)
                                {
                                    int percent = (int)((double)item.SoLuong / maxBuoi * 100);
                                    bool isPeak = percent == 100;
                                    string barColor = isPeak ? "bg-secondary" : "bg-secondary-fixed-dim/70 group-hover:bg-secondary";
                                    string textColor = isPeak ? "text-secondary font-bold" : "text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-secondary font-semibold";
                                    string monthColor = isPeak ? "text-on-surface font-bold" : "text-on-surface-variant";

                                    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 h-full justify-end group relative cursor-pointer">
                                        <div class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity absolute -top-8 px-2 py-1 bg-primary-container text-on-primary text-[10px] font-label-sm rounded shadow pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap z-10">
                                            @item.SoLuong ca
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] font-label-sm @textColor">@item.SoLuong</span>
                                        <div class="w-full max-w-[40px] @barColor rounded-t transition-all" style="height: @percent%"></div>
                                        <span class="text-[11px] font-label-md @monthColor">T@(item.Thang.Split('/')[0])</span>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

